Subject: [PATCH 09/12] mvc: run the dashboard's legacy reads in the web worker

Every dashboard refresh asked configd to start PHP or Python scripts for
a few milliseconds of work each, and starting them cost far more than
the work. Add OPNsense\Core\Legacy to load legacy includes and run
legacy scripts in the web server's PHP worker, which already has PHP
loaded, and use it for the Gateways, Services, Interface Statistics and
Interfaces APIs and the IPsec VTI list. Their output is unchanged.
